  "html": "<p>Go 的数组、切片和 <code>map</code> 表面上都能用下标或键值访问，底层内存布局和传递语义却完全不同。把数组当切片传会悄悄产生整段内存拷贝，往没初始化的 <code>map</code> 里写键值会直接 <code>panic</code>，理解它们的运行时结构才能把常见坑一次堵住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数组是固定长度的值类型\">数组是固定长度的值类型</h2>\n<p>Go 数组在声明时就锁死了长度，且<strong>长度是数组类型的一部分</strong>。<code>[3]int</code> 和 <code>[4]int</code> 在编译器眼里属于两种互不兼容的类型，既不能直接赋值，也不能传给同一个接收 <code>[3]int</code> 参数的函数。</p>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> overwriteFirst</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arr</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tarr[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 999</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 修改的是函数栈上的副本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\ta </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tb </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译器自动数出长度为 3，类型仍是 [3]int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\toverwriteFirst</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, a, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"equal b:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, a </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// a: [1 2 3] equal b: true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>数组赋值和传参都会完整拷贝全部元素，容量很大时开销显著，业务代码里通常只在尺寸固定（如 SHA-256 的 <code>[32]byte</code> 摘要）时直接使用数组。</strong></p>\n<p>Go 也不支持 Python 那种 <code>arr[-1]</code> 负向索引，访问最后一个元素必须老实写 <code>arr[len(arr)-1]</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"切片底层结构与-nil--空切片区别\">切片底层结构与 nil / 空切片区别</h2>\n<p>日常列表数据几乎全用切片（<code>[]T</code>）。切片本身是一个只有三个机器字长的描述符（在 64 位平台上固定占 24 字节），并不直接持有元素内存：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>Slice Header (24 bytes on 64-bit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌──────────────┬──────────┬──────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ Data (*T)    │ Len (int)│ Cap (int)│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└──────┬───────┴──────────┴──────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌───┬───┬───┬───┬───┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ a │ b │ c │   │   │   底层连续数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└───┴───┴───┴───┴───┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  0   1   2   3   4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Data</code>：指向底层数组起始位置的指针。</li>\n<li><code>Len</code>：当前可读写的有效元素个数，<code>len(s)</code> 读取它。</li>\n<li><code>Cap</code>：从 <code>Data</code> 指针算起到底层数组末尾的总槽位数，<code>cap(s)</code> 读取它。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>创建切片最容易混淆的是 <code>nil</code> 切片与空切片：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encoding/json</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tvar</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nilSlice []</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // Data == nil, len == 0, cap == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\temptySlice </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}       </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Data != nil（指向 zerobase），len == 0, cap == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tprealloc </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预分配 16 个槽位，len == 0, cap == 16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// nil 切片也能直接 append，无需先 make</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tnilSlice </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nilSlice, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"go\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tb1, _ </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Marshal</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tb2, _ </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Marshal</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(emptyS