span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tbase </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tsub </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// len=2, cap=4，与 base 共用底层数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tsub </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sub, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">99</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 未超过 cap=4，直接覆写 base[2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"base:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, base) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [1 2 99 4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sub :\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sub)  </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [1 2 99]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>第二个陷阱是<strong>扩容分离与内存滞留</strong>。当 <code>append</code> 触发元素数量超出 <code>cap</code> 时，runtime 会分配一块更大的新数组、把旧元素拷过去再返回新切片头；此后新旧切片彻底分家，互不影响。反过来，如果你从一个 10MB 的大切片里只切出 <code>huge[0:10]</code> 长期持有，整个 10MB 底层数组都无法被 GC 回收。</p>\n<p>避免这两个问题的工程手段有两个：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用三下标全切片表达式 <code>base[low:high:max]</code> 限制容量，例如 <code>base[0:2:2]</code> 把 <code>cap</code> 锁死为 <code>2</code>，后续对子切片 <code>append</code> 会强制触发新内存分配，绝不污染原切片。</li>\n<li>需要独立副本或只保留大切片的一小段时，显式使用 <code>copy</code> 或 <code>slices.Clone</code>：</li>\n</ol>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slices</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tsrc </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// 用三下标限制容量，append 立即分配新底层数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tisolated </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tisolated </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(isolated, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// 独立拷贝并排序（Go 1.21+ 推荐使用 slices 标准库）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tcloned </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slices.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Clone</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(src)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tslices.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sort</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cloned)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, src)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"isolated:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, isolated)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sorted clone:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cloned)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>凡是在函数里对传入的切片执行 <code>append</code>，调用方必须接住函数返回的新切片，因为一旦触发扩容，原切片头里的指针和长度都不会同步更新。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"map-初始化遍历随机性与并发禁忌\">Map 初始化、遍历随机性与并发禁忌</h2>\n<p><code>map[K]V</code> 是 Go 内置的哈希表，键类型 <code>K</code> 必须是可比较类型（如整数、字符串、指针、仅含可比较字段的结构体；切片、函数和 map 本身不能作为 key）。</p>\n<p><code>map</code> 的零值也是 <code>nil</code>，但它和 <code>nil</code> 切片的行为截然不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th><code>var m map[string]int</code>（<code>nil</code> map）</th>\n<th><code>m := make(map[string]int)</code>（已初始化）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>读取 <code>v := m[\"k\"]</code></td>\n<td>安全，返回零值 <code>0</code></td>\n<td>安全，存在返回值，不存在返回零值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在性检查 <code>v, ok := m[\"k\"]</code></td>\n<td>安全，<code>ok</code> 为 <code>false</code></td>\n<td>安全，精确区分键是否存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除 <code>delete(m, \"k\")</code></td>\n<td>安全，无操作</td>\n<td>安全，键不存在时无操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入 <code>m[\"k\"] = 1</code></td>\n<td><strong>直接 panic：<code>assignment to entry in nil map</code></strong></td>\n<td>安全，插入或更新键值对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong><code>nil</code> map 可以安全读取和删除，但只要执行写入操作就会立刻触发 <code>panic</code>，所有会写入的 map 必须通过 <code>make</code> 或字面量完成初始化。</strong></p>\n<p>利用 comma-ok 语法可以清晰区分“键不存在”和“键存在但值恰好为零值”：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maps</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slices</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// 已知大致容量时传给 make，能减少运行期哈希桶扩容搬迁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tscores </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tscores[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tscores[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bob\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tif</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v, ok </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]; ok {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice exists, score:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tif</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, ok </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"charlie\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ok {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"charlie missing\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// map 遍历顺序在每次运行时故意随机化；需要稳定输出时先对 key 排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tkeys </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slices.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sorted</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maps.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Keys</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scores))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tfor</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, k </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> keys {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Printf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d\\n</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, k, scores[k])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>Go 运行时在遍历 <code>map</code> 时会故意从随机桶和随机偏移开始，防止业务代码意外依赖哈希表内部顺序。更严格的一条红线在并发场景：<strong>原生 <code>map</code> 并发读写会触发不可 <code>recover</code> 的 <code>fatal error: concurrent map read and map write</code>，直接导致整个进程崩溃</strong>。跨 goroutine 共享映射时，必须配合 <code>sync.RWMutex</code> 加锁或改用 <code>sync.Map</code>，具体并发模型和锁用法见 <a href=\"/posts/go-concurrency-and-safety\">Go 并发入门：Goroutine、Channel、Select 与数据竞态</a>。</p>\n",
